## Implementation Summary

I have successfully completed **Task I1.T7: Provision local development tooling**. Here's what was delivered:

### Created Files

1. **`docker/docker-compose.yml`** (modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/db/migrations/V20260102__baseline_schema.sql:66)
   - Complete Docker Compose stack with PostgreSQL 17, MinIO (S3-compatible), Mailhog, and Jaeger
