2. **`.env.example`** (/.env.example)
   - Comprehensive template with all required configuration variables
   - Matches variable names from `application.properties:9`
   - Includes database, MinIO, SMTP, Stripe, JWT, and FFmpeg configuration
   - Detailed comments explaining each section
   - Safe defaults for local development

3. **`scripts/dev/bootstrap.sh`** (scripts/dev/bootstrap.sh)
   - Automated initialization script that orchestrates entire setup
   - Validates prerequisites (Docker, psql, FFmpeg)
   - Starts Compose stack with health checks
   - Runs Flyway migrations via Maven plugin
   - Seeds sample catalog data from `tools/scripts/sample_catalog_loader.sql`
   - Creates MinIO bucket for media storage
   - Provides detailed success/error messages with troubleshooting guidance
   - Supports `--skip-seed` and `--skip-minio` flags

4. **`scripts/dev/wait-for-postgres.sh`** (scripts/dev/wait-for-postgres.sh)
   - Reliable health check helper using `pg_isready`
   - Configurable timeout and retry logic
   - Clear error messages with troubleshooting steps
   - POSIX-compliant for maximum compatibility

5. **`docker/init-scripts/01-init-extensions.sql`** (docker/init-scripts/01-init-extensions.sql)
   - Automatically installs required PostgreSQL extensions on first boot
   - uuid-ossp, pgcrypto, and pg_trgm extensions

